Remove the Azure OpenAI provider (PATCH_OUT_AZURE, default 1).

Stubs vendored charm.land/fantasy/providers/azure: New() returns an error and
the github.com/openai/openai-go/v3/azure import is dropped, un-compiling the
entire Azure/azure-sdk-for-go family (azcore + sdk/internal) from the binary.
The option/type surface stays so Crush compiles untouched; a configured
azure-typed provider fails with an explicit error. See
tasks/reference/dependency-network-audit.md D7.

